'''Ancient Magamojoe''' (超古獣マガモジョー, ''Chō Kojū Magamojō'', '''Super Ancient Beast Magamojō''') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] variant of [[Casaurian Ahirujo]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]].

